  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>In the neighbourhood of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>